msgid ""
"路线来自 DS10693 Table10／11、DS11118 的精确封装 AF 表，以及 RM0390 Table29／ RM0386 "
"Table30。SAI2_B 的另一条硬件 DMA 请求未由当前路线选择，不能自行换 stream。 source block 由 route "
"推导；duplex 的 source 为 TX，另一 block 同步 RX。 每个 owner 独占所属 IP 的全局配置、A/B 两个 "
"blocks 及唯一 source vector；SAI1 为 IRQ87，F446 SAI2 为 IRQ91。关闭 SAI2 不修改仍由 "
"SAI1 持有的寄存器、gate、 IRQ 或 priority。跨 controller 配对及 DMA 冲突在取得硬件效果前拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Routes come from DS10693 Tables 10/11, the exact-package AF table in "
"DS11118, and RM0390 Table 29/RM0386 Table 30. The current routes do not "
"select the alternative hardware DMA request for SAI2_B; callers cannot "
"substitute another stream. The route determines the source block; in "
"duplex mode the source transmits and the other block receives "
"synchronously. Each owner exclusively controls its IP's global "
"configuration, both A/B blocks and the single source vector: IRQ87 for "
"SAI1 and IRQ91 for F446 SAI2. Closing SAI2 does not modify registers, "
"gates, IRQs or priorities still held by SAI1. Cross-controller pairing "
"and DMA conflicts are rejected before hardware effects."

msgid ""
"master 只消费 System ClockPlan 的唯一 `pll_sai.sai1` Q 输出；这里的 `sai1` 是现有 单一 Q "
"输出字段，SAI2 不另设第二份 PLL 参数。F446 SAI2 的已选 mux 也由 System 配置、回读和撤回。F446 "
"auxiliary M 独立，F479 与主 PLL 共用 M；Q／postQ 与 可选 LTDC R／postR 仍归同一 System "
"owner。驱动不修改 PLL 或 RCC mux。 普通 master 使用 `mckdiv=0` 的除1或 `2*mckdiv`，frame "
"bits 为二次幂； `no_divider=true` 禁止 MCLK、要求 mckdiv0，rate 为 kernel/frame bits。"
" 查询始终返回精确有理数，slave 为0/0 unknown。"
msgstr ""
"A master consumes only the System ClockPlan's single `pll_sai.sai1` Q "
"output. Here `sai1` is the existing field for that one Q output; SAI2 "
"does not introduce a second PLL parameter set. System also configures, "
"reads back and withdraws the selected F446 SAI2 mux. F446 has an "
"independent auxiliary M, while F479 shares M with the main PLL. Q/postQ "
"and optional LTDC R/postR remain with the same System owner. The driver "
"changes neither PLLs nor RCC muxes. A normal master divides by one when "
"`mckdiv=0`, otherwise by `2*mckdiv`, and requires a power-of-two frame "
"bit count. `no_divider=true` forbids MCLK, requires `mckdiv=0` and gives "
"rate kernel/frame bits. Queries always return an exact rational rate; a "
"slave reports unknown as 0/0."

msgid ""
"所有模式保守要求 APB2 严格大于两倍 SCK。`max_bit_clock_hz` 是所选 master 的 电气 "
"ceiling，或调用者保证的外部 slave 上界，不是实测值。实际选择 MCLK pad 时还要求共同已审 2.048–45MHz 范围；未选"
" MCLK 不附加该最低输出频率。引脚 使用数据手册表中的 OSPEEDR 二进制10，原恢复 snapshot 仍由 Platform 保持。"
msgstr ""
"All modes conservatively require APB2 to be strictly greater than twice "
"SCK. `max_bit_clock_hz` is the selected master's electrical ceiling or a "
"caller-guaranteed upper bound on external slave SCK, not a measurement. "
"Selecting an actual MCLK pad also requires the shared reviewed "
"2.048–45MHz range; an unselected MCLK imposes no such minimum output "
"frequency. Pins use binary10 in OSPEEDR as specified by the datasheet "
"tables; Platform retains the original restoration snapshots."

msgid ""
"官方 `HAL_SAI_Init` 负责联合冷态格式，Handle 仅在栈上存在。已审官方 DMA start／stop／abort "
"的私有等待和回调不直接建立 Nexus 完整归还证明，因此静态 选中的 C transport 独占 DMA 借用与退出。启用前和每个 "
"source／sink 效果之间 重新观察绝对 deadline 与原 System epoch，TX FIFO prime 使用显式 "
"service。 正常有限完成要求 source→sink 退出、FIFO／DMA／IRQ／地址全排空，才返回 TX 或 发布 RX，并 "
"SETTLED；有限错误／取消不发布有效结果。"
msgstr ""
"The official `HAL_SAI_Init` performs joint cold-format configuration, "
"with its Handle present only on the stack. The reviewed vendor DMA "
"start/stop/abort waits and callbacks do not directly prove complete Nexus"
" withdrawal, so the statically selected C transport exclusively owns DMA "
"borrowing and exit. It rechecks the absolute deadline and original System"
" epoch before enable and between source/sink effects; TX FIFO priming "
"uses explicit service. Normal finite completion requires source-then-sink"
" withdrawal and complete FIFO/DMA/IRQ/address drain before returning TX "
"or publishing RX, and reaching SETTLED. Finite errors and cancellation "
"publish no valid result."

msgid "SAI 连续 bank 交接"
msgstr "Continuous SAI bank handoff"

msgid ""
"连续配置额外给出 `max_service_gap_us`，包含任务抢占和本次 service 自身的最坏 间隔。调用者提供 "
"`nx_audio_blocks_request_t`、两个方向独立的 stream 和完整 frame 整数倍的 "
"`block_bytes`；单方向仍最多65535个自然容器。TX 至少两个 READY blocks， RX 至少三个 FREE "
"slots。所有控制、slot 元数据及完整 capacity 在首次接纳前校验， 不临时分配缓冲，不补静音、不重放，也不创建后台 worker。"
msgstr ""
"Continuous configuration additionally declares `max_service_gap_us`, "
"including task preemption and the worst interval consumed by service "
"itself. The caller supplies `nx_audio_blocks_request_t`, separate streams"
" for the two directions and `block_bytes` containing an integer number of"
" complete frames. Each direction remains limited to 65535 natural "
"containers. TX needs at least two READY blocks and RX at least three FREE"
" slots. All controls, slot metadata and full buffer capacities are "
"validated before initial admission. There is no temporary buffer "
"allocation, silence insertion, replay or background worker."

msgid "时点"
msgstr "Point"

msgid "硬件与借用责任"
msgstr "Hardware and borrowing responsibility"

msgid "接纳"
msgstr "Admission"

msgid "原 session、stream 和两个 DMA bank 保持借用；拒绝没有效果或引用残留"
msgstr ""
"The original session, streams and two DMA banks remain borrowed; "
"rejection leaves no effects or retained references"

msgid "IRQ"
msgstr "IRQ"

msgid "只锁存 TC／error；FIFO error 掩蔽源，不能在 IRQ 里发布或替换借用"
msgstr ""
"Only latch TC/error; mask FIFO error sources, and never publish or "
"replace loans in the IRQ"

msgid "service"
msgstr "service"

msgid "先取得 replacement，再更新非活动地址；重新观察 CT、硬件／锁存事件和时间预算"
msgstr ""
"Acquire a replacement before updating the inactive address, then recheck "
"CT, hardware/latched events and the time budget"

msgid "发布／归还"
msgstr "Publish / return"

msgid "上述检查全部成立，旧 RX 才发布、旧 TX 才归还；两个方向独立前进"
msgstr ""
"Publish old RX or return old TX only after every check succeeds; the two "
"directions advance independently"

msgid "停止"
msgstr "Stop"

msgid "先停 source 再 sink，撤回 DMA 请求并排空 DMA／IRQ，清空全部地址与 FIFO，再返回未完成 bank"
msgstr ""
"Stop source before sink, withdraw DMA requests and join DMA/IRQs, then "
"clear every address and the FIFO before returning unfinished banks"

msgid "失败"
msgstr "Failure"

msgid "拒撤或历史丢失保持 QUARANTINED，原 session、旧 bank、replacement 和资源均保留"
msgstr ""
"Refused withdrawal or lost history keeps QUARANTINED; retain the original"
" session, old banks, replacement and resources"

msgid ""
"准入用实际 wire frame bits 和有效样本数换算块时长，预留八字 FIFO、一个 serializer 样本及一个直接 DMA "
"传输的保守裕量，再要求剩余时长大于两倍 service 上界加两微秒。 源的真实 clock 不得超过声明值，应用还需按时补 TX、归还 "
"RX。检查预算、CT／TC 只能建立这些前提下的软件交接，不能追溯保证违反预算之前的物理音频。"
msgstr ""
"Admission derives block duration from the actual wire-frame bit count and"
" enabled sample count. It conservatively reserves an eight-word FIFO, one"
" serializer sample and one direct DMA transfer, then requires the "
"remaining duration to exceed twice the service bound plus two "
"microseconds. The actual source clock must not exceed its declaration, "
"and the application must replenish TX and release RX on time. Budget and "
"CT/TC checks establish software handoff only under those assumptions; "
"they cannot retrospectively guarantee physical audio behavior before a "
"budget violation is observed."

msgid ""
"缺 replacement、bank 歧义或超预算会停止并报告 OVERFLOW；不能覆盖 READY／BORROWED 块。已经发布的 RX "
"前缀在停止后继续有效，需要消费者单独 release；未借用的 TX READY 仍留在原队列。连续 `base.transferred` 选择 "
"RX 时统计已发布 RX 字节，否则 统计已脱离 DMA 的 TX 字节；错误／取消仍可带有效前缀，不代表精确 wire frame 数。 "
"普通拒撤可在原 epoch 重试，丢失历史不能用恢复寄存器外观解除。SETTLED 是对 session "
"和生产／消费权限的最后访问，不撤销先前独立的 RX consumer loans。"
msgstr ""
"A missing replacement, ambiguous bank progress or exceeded budget stops "
"the session with OVERFLOW; READY/BORROWED blocks must not be overwritten."
" A previously published RX prefix remains valid after stop and requires "
"separate consumer release; TX READY blocks not borrowed by DMA remain in "
"the original queue. Continuous `base.transferred` counts published RX "
"bytes when RX is selected, otherwise TX bytes detached from DMA. Errors "
"and cancellation may retain a valid prefix, not an exact wire-frame "
"count. Ordinary refused withdrawal may be retried in the original epoch; "
"lost history cannot be repaired by restoring the appearance of register "
"values. SETTLED is the final access to the session and producer/consumer "
"rights; it does not revoke earlier independent RX consumer loans."

msgid ""
"`tests/contracts/stm32f4_sai/` 保留原四个有限 reference，并新增 F446 SAI2、F479 稀疏 "
"mask 的 master／slave duplex blocks。两个公共消费者分别覆盖布局和显式 caller-owned "
"session。GoogleTest 验证真实 C 的交接、欠供给、替换拒写、CT 竞态、 epoch 与停止失败；ARM ELF／Source "
"SDK 分别验证实际源码选择及外部消费。 PCB、codec、外部时钟、波形、FIFO 余量与持续负载仍须物理执行，当前 HIL 为 "
"`not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"`tests/contracts/stm32f4_sai/` retains the four original finite "
"references and adds master/slave duplex blocks for F446 SAI2 and F479 "
"sparse masks. Two public consumers cover layout and an explicit caller-"
"owned session respectively. GoogleTest checks actual C handoff, "
"starvation, refused replacement writes, CT races, epochs and failed stop."
" ARM ELF and Source SDK separately verify source selection and external "
"consumption. PCB, codec, external clocks, waveforms, FIFO margin and "
"sustained load still need physical execution; current HIL is "
"`not_executed`."

msgid "装配与验证入口"
msgstr "Assembly and validation"

msgid "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` 是外部 software-only Board 夹具，覆盖 VE RAW12 配 I2S2 duplex、ZG embedded RAW blocks 配 I2S3、ZG RAW14、JPEG 以及 I2S3 MCLK。 `jpeg_blocks/ve-jpeg-blocks.toml` 复用 VE 软件路线，独立强类型消费者显式提供三个 4096 B bank 并调用 start／service／acquire／release／stop；不增加其他有限夹具的 RAM。 它们不修改公共 Board 的接线事实。`tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` 检查严格字段、typed IR、真实 claims、pure factory 及固定生命周期连接。 `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` 编译真实 C11 owner 和官方 DCMI cold Init， 只替换 CPU／MMIO 边界；失败 drain、迟到 IRQ、CT 歧义、欠替代 buffer、原始借用及 多实例共享时钟均在同一个完整程序中执行。模型结果、ARM ELF 和 HIL 分别验收； 本软件工作不执行 HIL。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` provides external software-only Board fixtures: VE RAW12 with I2S2 duplex, ZG embedded RAW blocks with I2S3, ZG RAW14, JPEG and I2S3 MCLK. `jpeg_blocks/ve-jpeg-blocks.toml` reuses the VE software route. Its independent strongly typed consumer supplies three 4096 B banks and calls start/service/acquire/release/stop; it adds no RAM to other finite fixtures. These fixtures do not change public Board wiring facts. `tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` checks strict fields, typed IR, actual claims, pure factory lookup and fixed lifecycle connections. `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` compiles the real C11 owner and official DCMI cold Init, replacing only CPU/MMIO boundaries. The same complete program covers failed drain, late IRQs, ambiguous CT, exhausted replacements, original borrowing and shared multi-instance clocks. Model results, ARM ELF and HIL are accepted separately; this software work executes no HIL."

msgid "旧 I2S2 专用角色迁移"
msgstr "Retiring the dedicated I2S2 role"

msgid "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 和 `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 保留参考输入名称，改用 随 SDK 交付的 `f407-audio-reference/ve`、`zg` 软件 Board，不声明 Sky 或启明实板 音频接线。标准 `[audio.sound]` 与 factory／Platform 已覆盖原 Philips stereo16 引脚、DMA 和完整借用职责；旧 `[i2s2]`、组件、手动 owner 初始化及专用 driver 已删除。"
msgstr "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` and `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` retain their reference filenames but use shipped `f407-audio-reference/ve` and `zg` software Boards without claiming Sky or Qiming physical audio wiring. Standard `[audio.sound]`, factory and Platform cover the original Philips stereo16 pads, DMA and complete borrowing duties. Legacy `[i2s2]`, its component, manual owner initialization and dedicated driver are removed."

msgid "旧程序中仍有效的回归转入同一个 capture/audio 程序："
msgstr "Still-valid regressions from the old program move into the same capture/audio program:"

msgid "原职责"
msgstr "Original duty"

msgid "保留的独立行为验证"
msgstr "Retained independent behavior checks"

msgid "prefill、冻结时钟、WS 丢失"
msgstr "Prefill, frozen clocks and lost WS"

msgid "真实三微秒 tick、DR/NDTR/TXE、保持 idle 后才 ACTIVE"
msgstr "Actual three-microsecond ticks, DR/NDTR/TXE, and idle preserved before ACTIVE"

msgid "TC／NDTR 不能归还借用"
msgstr "TC/NDTR cannot release a borrow"

msgid "新读 TXE 后再读 BSY，取消／deadline／停止失败保留 loan"
msgstr "Fresh TXE before BSY; cancellation/deadline/stop failures retain the loan"

msgid "DMA／IRQ／地址退出失败"
msgstr "Failed DMA/IRQ/address withdrawal"

msgid "duplex 和 TX 的完整借用、停止重试及已取得的线上排空证明"
msgstr "Complete duplex/TX borrows, stop retries and already-obtained wire-drain proof"

msgid "几何、DMA 权限、计数上限"
msgstr "Geometry, DMA permissions and count limits"

msgid "非空防溢出整块 rows、禁止 padding、131068B stereo16 上界"
msgstr "Nonempty nonwrapping complete rows, no padding, 131068B stereo16 bound"

msgid "伪造及别名控制"
msgstr "Forged and aliased controls"

msgid "copied／stale／未对齐 loan、request 落在未用 payload capacity 尾部"
msgstr "Copied/stale/misaligned loans and a request placed in unused payload-capacity tail"

msgid "read-clear 与历史丢失"
msgstr "Read-clear and lost history"

msgid "首次 SR 故障、reset／DMA gate／时基／epoch 丢失后永久 quarantine"
msgstr "Initial SR faults and permanent quarantine after reset/DMA-gate/timebase/epoch loss"

msgid "SETTLED 最后访问"
msgstr "SETTLED as final access"

msgid "provider 清除所有 payload 引用，控制块 PROT_NONE 后迟到 IRQ 和 close"
msgstr "All payload references detached before late IRQ/close with control storage set PROT_NONE"

msgid "执行上下文及共享状态"
msgstr "Execution context and shared state"

msgid "privilege／ISR／三个 incoming masks、共享 PLL、邻 DMA、IRQ 原优先级"
msgstr "Privilege/ISR/three incoming masks, shared PLL, neighboring DMA and original IRQ priorities"

msgid "原手动 face／storage ABI 的布局检查随该 ABI 退出。原 System 特殊 gate 分支的三项 测试只证明手动调用者已自行 join 的前提，随该架构删除；标准 Platform 现在实际调用 audio close，无法完成借用排空就拒绝资源撤回。cold 状态及共享 GPIO／DMA 门由已有 Platform 资源 owner 统一取得，factory 不再允许调用者构造第二个硬件 owner。 linked provider 验证沿用普通 generated face→共享只读方法表→真实私有函数的同一机制， 无需专用角色、公共 opaque storage 或另一个硬件发现入口。"
msgstr "Layout checks of the manual face/storage ABI retire with that ABI. Three tests of special System gates proved only that manual callers had joined their users and retire with that architecture. Standard Platform now actually calls audio close and refuses resource withdrawal without complete borrow drain. Existing Platform resource owners acquire cold state and shared GPIO/DMA gates. Factory no longer lets callers construct a second hardware owner. Linked-provider verification uses the same generated-face→shared-read-only-method-table→actual-private-function mechanism without a dedicated role, public opaque storage or another discovery entry point."
